docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T80.md:12:This task delivers the large-repo performance test suite that proves the hot-path budgets from Phases 1 and 2 hold at realistic scale, not only on the toy repo the unit tests use. Spec §Phase 1 sets identity resolution at ≤2ms P99; spec §Phase 2 sets event write at ≤5ms P99 on `prepare_change` and `get_context_capsule`; spec §Non-Negotiable Product Properties bans "unbounded graph traversal, payload growth, or event-log scans on hot paths." This task takes the fixture repos captured by T66 (large-repo fixtures from the benchmark suite — multiple languages, multiple repo sizes) and exercises every hot path against them, asserts the P99 budgets, and writes the results to `large_repo_results.json` for the metrics dashboard and R87 review.
