docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T68.md:12:This task ships the `lattice_report` binary and its supporting `metrics/report.rs` module so operators and CI can render the full Phase 9 metric set from the T65 collector and the T66 benchmark output. Spec §Phase 9 Deliverables names "regression dashboard or CLI report" as binding and the Phase 9 DoD requires that "changes to retrieval, memory, and workflow behavior can be evaluated without relying on anecdote." The CLI is the surface that turns the metrics module into something a human or CI job can read.
