docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T32.md:12:This task closes Phase 4 with the benchmark suite, golden anchor fixtures, and ranking regression tests required by spec §Phase 4 deliverables ("benchmark suite for realistic assistant tasks") and §Phase 4 Definition of Done ("irrelevant memory rate is measured and regressed"). The benchmark must measure end-to-end retrieval against a fixed set of representative tasks, the golden anchor tests must pin the anchor-resolution behaviour against a curated corpus, and ranking regression tests must guard against silent reordering of the ranked output as future signals are tuned. Metrics are written to a baseline JSON file under `docs/plans/.../baselines/` so future runs can diff against it without re-reading the test fixtures.
