+## Issues encountered
+
+- The initial Criterion closure rebuilt and re-indexed each fixture on every iteration. The harness now indexes each fixture once per benchmark function and still writes the full end-to-end report before benchmarking.
+- Criterion executes the benchmark binary in a read-only view for repository writes in this environment. The benchmark writes a shadow report to `/tmp/lattice-benchmarks/cognitive_workspace_metrics.json`; after each successful run, that generated report was copied to `docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/baselines/cognitive_workspace_metrics.json`.
